WEBVTT

00:01.120 --> 00:02.160
Your son

00:02.240 --> 00:03.640
Indeed has selfish motives

00:04.400 --> 00:05.520
No matter what

00:05.600 --> 00:06.280
Father's important matters

00:06.360 --> 00:08.027
All require the Chen family

00:08.400 --> 00:09.560
If your son reports this

00:09.640 --> 00:11.040
For Father to handle

00:11.240 --> 00:13.520
Wouldn't that put Father in a dilemma?

00:13.600 --> 00:15.000
So this villain

00:15.520 --> 00:16.920
Should be your son

00:17.760 --> 00:19.160
Good

00:20.120 --> 00:21.520
What a villain
